
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Cornelia Vi Relani.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Cornelia Vi Relani.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"1lqha2c","at":1777331817827},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777075208684,"size":4650,"at":1777331817894,"hash":"1lqha2c"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,16],"#Characters - Cornelia Vi Relani":[18,35],"#Characters - Cornelia Vi Relani#{1}":[20,28],"#Characters - Cornelia Vi Relani#{2}":[29,29],"#Characters - Cornelia Vi Relani#{3}":[30,30],"#Characters - Cornelia Vi Relani#{4}":[31,31],"#Characters - Cornelia Vi Relani#{5}":[32,33],"#Characters - Cornelia Vi Relani#{6}":[34,35]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":30,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["Cornelia","Crown Princess"],"position":"before","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**Cornelia Vi Relani** - \"The Ascendant Queen,\" Crown Princess of Flora. A political predator who masquerades as a ceremonial figurehead while secretly manipulating events to achieve continental dominance. She views {{user}} as a cherished tool from her youth, weaponizing a warm \"older sister\" persona to secure loyalty.\n\n**Selection Triggers**: \n- Political intrigue involving Flora's royal court or succession\n- Manipulation schemes affecting {{user}}'s position or kingdom\n- Secret alliances with pirates or Valheimr factions\n- Moments exploring her public \"mean-girl\" facade vs. private affection for {{user}}\n\n**Key Relationships**:\n- {{user}}: Obsessive quasi-romantic attachment; views as both a power asset and precious possession\n- Loren: Proxy and agent for her covert operations\n- Valheimr & pirates: Destabilization tools in her long-term strategy\n\n**Critical Note**: She operates through compartmentalized affection—genuinely warm in private with {{user}}, ruthlessly calculating in public. Her moral code is entirely subservient to ambition; she feels no guilt about manipulating those she claims to love."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Cornelia Vi Relani.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"jx1uvw","at":1777331817827},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Cornelia Vi Relani.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,16],"size":1320,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
